{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"Johnathan sits down and says \"Here come sit\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:24:02.304000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865916754819809290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"She moved over to sit, and blushed a little. “So, is this something you do often?”","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:24:56.424000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865916981814624277","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"Not in a long time. My Godmother used to take me on picnic's all the time. And then at the temple in Liverpool once I went with Several of the other Acolytes. But that was awhile ago\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:29:04.104000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865918020660887582","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"“Did you ever.. date anyone?” She asked, taking a piece of cheese and nibbling on it.","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:30:25.277000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865918361123815444","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"No no no, nothing like that. When I was 14 I took a vow of celibacy, much like our Goddess Athena, to get closer to her. Some saw it as a drastic measure but so far it has served me well... ||except||...\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:35:03.848000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865919529535930408","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"Johnathan shakes his head and eats a piece of cheese","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:35:25.105000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865919618693201930","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"She looked down at the cheese in her hands. She then forced herself to look at him. “I’m sorry..”","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:36:31.992000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865919899238924308","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"Sorry for what. You haven't done anything. I have lived a happy life devoted to Athena. I have had no regret's so far\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:37:53.773000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865920242252382209","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"“I just..” She looked back at the cheese in her hand. She then switched to Infernal to whisper. ||*”I like you…”*||","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:41:27.734000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865921139669467166","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"It's of no matter now anyways.\" Johnathan lays his back on the ground to look at the stars \"I am curious, have you ever dated anyone either? I hope I am not being rude\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:47:40.195000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865922701884915732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"She looked at him. “No. I… was always hesitant around boys growing up. And besides, Tiefling. Not many people want that.”","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:49:50.931000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865923250231574528","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"Well I stand by what I said earlier, I think you're quite the catch, any chap would be spoiled if they had you\"","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:52:05.026000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865923812666245150","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"She felt herself blushing more. “Y-you mean it?”","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:53:09.797000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865924084335640586","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"852739507647545364","content":"\"Yes, I'd like to think I do mean it. You're a cut above most other people I have met, and quite attractive as well\" Johnathan just realizing what he said, blushes and turns his head off to the side","created_at":"2021-07-17T11:55:47.587000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865924746155393035","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
